      "content": "SP 91 NW                  PITSTONE             CHEDDINGTON ROAD 4/143                                          Barn to N.W. of Orchard Farmhouse - -                                              II Barn.  Late C18, altered.  Timber frame and weatherboard, brick plinth, tiled roof with half hip at E. end. 4 bays.  2 C20 metal casements to south, board door in E. gable.  Roof structure mostly renewed with slight raking queen posts.  Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP9321816070"
    }
